 [source('legoff_ephe','EPHE prosopographical notice, Jacques Le Goff, reproducing Jean-Claude Schmitt’s substantive account.','https://prosopo.ephe.psl.eu/jacques-le-goff','Institutional notice read, including Schmitt-attributed paragraph on the 1964 synthesis and bibliographic list. Argument claims remain mediated by this named reader; Le Goff’s book itself unread. Notice records birth 1924 and death 1 April 2014. Les Intellectuels is dated 1957 in the narrative but 1956 in its list; neither is adopted as a new event.',True)],
